<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank Q1 oper profit up 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank Q1 oper profit up 1.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   649    up 1.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group own-account trade profit	  74.4   up 72.2 pct</p>
<p>    Group net interest income		 1,057  down 7.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group net commission income	     344.8  up 51.2 pct</p>
<p>    Group administrative expenses	   837.6  up 3.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG. The bank said the above results will be announced by chief executive Eberhard Martini at an investor relations presentation to institutional investors and analysts in London.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
